So i followed DucatiKiller's answer and sent it in to the dealership. They have no clue to what the problem can be - but are changing the starter. We will see how it will work out. 

New update ! ! Edit ;
So they changed the starter and it worked about 1 month, and then it just went complete dead.. So it went back in, and now they have changed the ignition button. Time will show if this works.
